{"title":"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has side length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, and the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/2816113f65ba2479f2b96ac29e5eb6ed0cdd6b31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/e/5deb6040701b50303c4593a48dd3b09550139cd9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D,E; A=(0,0); B=(0,50); C=(50,50); D=(50,0); E = (40,50); draw(A--B); draw(B--E); draw(E--C); draw(C--D); draw(D--A); draw(A--E); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(E); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,NW); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,SE); label(&quot;E&quot;,E,N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/0/a607c919596f83879b2ffa0c099d997c7efc3018.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\ 7 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ 8 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"384\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6b5b6b078188523fb69a22aff2fbd2b3df42b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>The area of a triangle is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/8/2a8a4739d6a26db5c4596d54cf765a7b63a53fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\frac{bh}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> as the height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/3/4d3a4c3aa665381c1964f2f02b5f168fec979d68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 = \\frac{10b}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b447277e683dbf98cb0cbcbddf0debfd717e1c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 8$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wW_GidbHnnM\">https://youtu.be/wW_GidbHnnM</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2vf843cvVzo?t=0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2vf843cvVzo?t=0</a>\n~sugar_rush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A\">2013 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</